> Currently, Brown Bag consists of Dave Waterman ([V]ocals/G[uit]ar), Mike Ellis (Keys/[V]ocals),[ Jack] Pieroth (Bass), Dan Cantone (G[uitar]/[V]ocals), and Matt Rezetko (Drums).
Brown Bag has played[ shows] at The Beverly Arts Center, Wh[ippers]nap Music Fest 2012, ShoeFest 2012, Martyr’s, Tonic Room, Ace Bar, Reggie’s, Harte’s and host their own annual festival, “Oink Fest” plus numerous more.
